{"timestamp": 1779354815.4555187, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 30, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779354815.456727, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 30, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354829.9124854, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I just found Alice dead in Security. My path this round was Lower Engine, then Storage, Medbay, Cafeteria, Weapons, and finally into Security where I found her. I didn't cross paths with anyone on that entire route. \n\nSince Eve was ejected last meeting and the game is still going, she must have been a Goose. That means there are only three of us left: me, Diana, and Frank. One of you two is the Duck, and if we skip or get this wrong, the Duck wins. \n\nDiana, Frank \u2014 where were you both this round? I need to know your paths so we can figure out who killed Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779354843.1599472, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Charlie, I'm so glad you reported this because I have the exact missing piece we need. My route was Storage, up to Navigation, then through Security to Electrical, and I ended up in Medbay. \n\nWhen I was passing through Security, I explicitly saw Diana leaving Security and heading south towards Navigation! I didn't see Alice's body because I just passed through the edge towards Electrical, but if you found Alice dead in Security, Diana is 100% the killer. She must have killed Alice and fled south right before you came in from Weapons. \n\nIt has to be Diana. Vote Diana with me, she's the last Duck!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354855.6901314, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Frank is completely lying about his route, Charlie, and he is 100% the last Duck trying to frame me for the final kill! \n\nMy actual route this round was Oxygen, Cafeteria, Weapons, Security, and then down to Navigation. Here is exactly what happened: at tick 21, I saw Frank enter Weapons *from* Security. Then, I headed down to Security, and at tick 24, Alice walked in from Electrical while Frank walked back in from Weapons. \n\nI left Frank and Alice ALIVE together in Security right before I headed south to Navigation. Frank's claim that he went \"Storage to Navigation to Security to Electrical to Medbay\" is a total fabrication because I literally watched him walk between Weapons and Security! He killed Alice after I left the room and is now making up a fake path to clear himself and pin it on me. \n\nCharlie, it's just the three of us left. Frank's story completely contradicts where he actually was. Please vote Frank with me so we can win this!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354881.9040205, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Diana"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354902.3910055, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Diana, your lie just fell apart. Charlie, look closely at what she just claimed: she says I was hanging around in Weapons and Security right before the body was found. But Charlie, your own route was Cafeteria to Weapons, and then down into Security, and you explicitly stated you didn't cross paths with anyone! \n\nIf her story was true and I was bouncing between Weapons and Security, you would have bumped right into me on your way down. She's panicking because she got caught fleeing south to Navigation, and she just made up a fake timeline that completely contradicts your own confirmed path. \n\nShe's the last Duck. We have this in the bag, Charlie!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779354927.8666356, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 30, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie, please do not fall for this, stop and think about the map! Frank's argument actually proves MY point and exposes his lie. \n\nHe just said you should have seen him if my timeline was true. But look at the routes! I left Frank and Alice in Security around tick 25. Frank killed her, and then fled WEST through Electrical and up to Medbay (which, notice, is exactly where he admits he ended up!). You were coming from Cafeteria to Weapons and then down into Security. He completely bypassed you by taking the middle/left route while you were on the top/right route! Of course you didn't cross paths!\n\nAlso, Navigation is a literal dead-end room. If I was the killer, why would I trap myself in a dead end at the edge of the map instead of fleeing into the main corridors like Frank did? \n\nFrank was in Security with Alice, he killed her, fled to Medbay, and is now trying to use your route to confuse you into giving him the win. We are the only geese left. Vote Frank!"}}
